OL,3,GNEWSAStudent housing plan for asylum   
OL,4,Aseeker hotel site                      
OL,6,FPlans are being put together to        
OL,7,Fdemolish a hotel used to accommodate   
OL,8,Fasylum seekers and replace it with     
OL,9,Fstudent accommodation.                 
OL,11,FDeveloper Gilltown wants to demolish   
OL,12,Fthe Highfield House Hotel in Portswood,
OL,13,FSouthampton, and build a new managed   
OL,14,Fstudent accommodation building of about
OL,15,F260-bedrooms.                          
OL,17,FThe proposals follow confirmation that 
OL,18,Fthe Home Office will stop using the    
OL,19,Fhotel to accommodate people seeking    
OL,20,Fasylum.                                
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
