OL,3,GNEWSAStudent housing plan for asylum   
OL,4,Aseeker hotel site                      
OL,6,FGilltown said it had organised a public
OL,7,Fevent in Portswood on 8 December to    
OL,8,Fshow residents its early plans.        
OL,9,FSouthampton City Council said the      
OL,10,Fstudent accommodation developer had    
OL,11,Fengaged in a pre-application process   
OL,12,Fwith the council's planning team.      
